39.44  keys space esc esc
41.89  keys@0.12 f1 down down down enter
42.57  keys@0.06 down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down
43.61  expect Roman Gladiator
43.81  keys space esc esc

# Roman Gladiator off: plain background for the header art.
46.26  keys@0.12 f1 down down down enter
46.94  keys@0.06 down down down down down down down down down down down down down down down
47.98  expect Roman Gladiator
48.18  keys space esc esc

# Hyprland only: one row up from Mango with the field focused, then page through its art.
49.23  keys up
49.63  keys@0.35 pgdn pgdn pgdn pgdn pgdn pgdn pgdn pgdn

# Mango only: the first PgDn wraps the shared index to 0, then lands on ascii_6.
52.58  keys down
52.98  keys@0.45 pgdn pgdn pgdn pgdn pgdn pgdn

